<title>UK: Commerzbank sets NZ$100 million March 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets NZ$100 million March 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    04.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.625   PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA-   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
